  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development by reason of the poor outlook and light provision to the flank ground floor bedrooms in conjunction with lack of adequate bathroom space for a family unit, results in a substandard level of habitable&amp;nbsp; accommodation and living conditions for future occupiers.&amp;nbsp; As such, the development is contrary to the policies D3 D (7) and (11) and D6 of The London Plan (2021) and policies DM1 and DM26 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), The London Plan Guidance: Housing Design Standards (2023), and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
